    "difficultyReason": "A word context must be turned into a two-event Venn or addition-rule model with a symbolic probability p/20. Part a needs P(train only) = P(train) − P(both). Part b needs the complement to give P(train or bus), then a linear equation in p. This is a routine linked procedure with light algebra, and part a scaffolds part b.",
